# Subvertadown's published rankings, typed by hand. Rename to
# subvertadown_week_1.csv to benchmark against it.
# A `position` column lets one file carry both lists; without it, a `team`
# column is read as D/ST and a `player` column as K.
position,rank,name
DST,1,Jaguars
DST,2,Chargers
DST,3,Seahawks
K,1,Cameron Dicker
K,2,Jake Bates
K,3,Daniel Carlson
